#NEXUS

[ wang2024a_fig6: Paravian consensus, read from crops. The Roman numerals I-XVII are keys to a legend printed in the figure (I Paraves ... XVII Galliformes), not names on the tree, so, as with caption keys, they are not encoded. Multi-way nodes: Anchiornithinae, the Archaeopteryx specimen node and its three-specimen node, a four-way troodontid node (Almas, Papiliovenator, the Philovenator clade and the rest), the first two microraptorine nodes, Euenantiornithes, the Songlingornis-Yixianornis-Yanornis node, Ornithurae (XIV, four-way) and Aves (XV). 75 tips, 10 polytomies (4, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 4, 4, 3 children). Random-sample case (seed 20261122). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

